 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜について: about (the topic)",
     "texto": [
      "To say what something is about: **にほん の ぶんか に ついて はなします** (I'll talk about Japanese culture).",
      "It's used a lot in presentations and at work."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜にとって: from the point of view of",
     "texto": [
      "It marks for whom something is evaluated: **わたし に とって、 にほんご は むずかしい です** (for me, Japanese is difficult). It doesn't introduce the topic being discussed; for that, use **について**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜に対して: toward; with respect to",
     "texto": [
      "It marks the object of an action, attitude or response: **この けいかく に たいして、 きびしい いけん が でました** (critical opinions were voiced about this plan). It doesn't always mean \"to be against\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
